{"story":{"id":"event-first-contact-critters-15","title":{"zh":"缇扬奇","en":"Tiyanki"},"category":"society","kind":"event","image":"art/e4f1230f74621514f3e8.webp","start":"first_contact_critters.15","chapters":1,"visible":true,"excerpt":{"zh":"我们称之为“缇扬奇”的太空生物十分温顺。它们可以进入低维度的亚空间，因此可以轻易地在星系之间遨游。\n\n它们以气态巨行星外层常见的气体为食。这不太可能是它们唯一的食物来源，但到目前为止尚未观察到其他的进食方式。\n\n它们不会主动进攻，因此可以安全地无视它们。","en":"The spaceborne lifeforms - which we call \"Tiyanki\" - are docile creatures. Capable of accessing some lower dimension of subspace, they roam from system to system with remarkable ease.\n\nThey graze on gases common to the upper layers of many gas giants. It is hi"},"tree":{"root":"n0","nodes":{"n0":{"doc":null,"children":["n1"]},"n1":{"doc":"first_contact_critters.15","parent":"n0","via":{"kind":"entry","triggers":[{"zh":"首次接触","en":"First contact"}]},"children":[]}}}},"chapters":[{"id":"first_contact_critters.15","kind":"event","title":{"zh":"缇扬奇","en":"Tiyanki"},"texts":[{"zh":"我们称之为“缇扬奇”的太空生物十分温顺。它们可以进入低维度的亚空间，因此可以轻易地在星系之间遨游。\n\n它们以气态巨行星外层常见的气体为食。这不太可能是它们唯一的食物来源，但到目前为止尚未观察到其他的进食方式。\n\n它们不会主动进攻，因此可以安全地无视它们。","en":"The spaceborne lifeforms - which we call \"Tiyanki\" - are docile creatures. Capable of accessing some lower dimension of subspace, they roam from system to system with remarkable ease.\n\nThey graze on gases common to the upper layers of many gas giants. It is highly unlikely, to say the least, that this is their only food source, but intake of other nutrients has yet to be observed.\n\nThey will not attack unless provoked. They can safely be ignored."},{"zh":"圣者们将那个漂浮在黑暗中的存在称为“缇扬奇”。他们是神圣而酷爱和平的太空生命体，从一个恒星系漫步到另一个恒星系，依靠众多气态巨行星上表面的常见气体进食，几乎不会有任何表现敌意的情况。\n\n我们应该与其保持距离，以示敬意。","en":"The Diviners name the beings, floating through the dark, \"Tiyanki.\" They are a sacred and peaceful spaceborne life form that roams from system to system, feeding on gases common to the upper layers of many gas giants, and rarely showing any signs of hostility.\n\nWe are to keep at a respectful distance."},{"zh":"[Owner.GetSpeciesAdj]的社会学研究领袖称之为缇扬奇”的太空生物十分温顺。它们可以进入低维度的亚空间，因此可以轻易地在星系之间遨游。\n\n它们以气态巨行星外层常见的气体为食。这不太可能是它们唯一的食物来源，但到目前为止尚未观察到其他的进食方式。\n\n它们不会主动进攻，因此可以安全地无视它们。","en":"The spaceborne lifeforms - which the [Owner.GetSpeciesAdj] Head of Society Research has come to refer to as \"Tiyanki\" - are docile creatures. Capable of accessing some lower dimension of subspace, they roam from system to system with remarkable ease.\n\nThey graze on gases common to the upper layers of many gas giants. It is highly unlikely, to say the least, that this is their only food source, but intake of other nutrients has yet to be observed.\n\nThey will rarely, if ever, attack, even when provoked. They can safely be ignored."},{"zh":"","en":""},{"zh":"值得注意的是，每个缇扬奇群体都以母系等级制度为中心，由一头雌兽领导。雌性优先享用所有食物资源，以便为幼崽生产气态母体物质，并引导群体迁徙。因此，雄兽在资源匮乏时会放弃进食，鼓励它们在群体休息时寻找更多食物。","en":"Of note, there is a matriarchal hierarchy at the center of each Tiyanki pod, with a singular cow leading the group at any one time. Females are given priority to all food resources, allowing them to produce maternal gases for their young and direct the pod's migrations. As such, bulls will forgo nourishment whenever resources are scarce, encouraging them to scout for more food while the pod rests."}],"sections":[],"image":"art/e4f1230f74621514f3e8.webp","hidden":false,"choices":[{"key":"story.501.a.spiri","label":{"zh":"令人钦佩。","en":"Venerable."},"responses":[],"tooltips":[],"conditional":true,"next":[],"terminal":false,"when":[[{"type":"identity","key":"ethic_spiritualist","value":true,"label":{"zh":"唯心主义","en":"Spiritualist"}}]]},{"key":"story.501.a.mater","label":{"zh":"捕猎他们也捞不到什么好处。","en":"Hunting them would be a net loss anyway."},"responses":[],"tooltips":[],"conditional":true,"next":[],"terminal":false,"when":[[{"type":"identity","key":"ethic_materialist","value":true,"label":{"zh":"唯物主义","en":"Materialist"}},{"type":"identity","key":"civic_machine_exploration_protocol","value":false,"label":{"zh":"探险协议","en":"Exploration Protocols"}}],[{"type":"identity","key":"ethic_gestalt_consciousness","value":true,"label":{"zh":"格式塔意识","en":"Gestalt Consciousness"}},{"type":"identity","key":"civic_machine_exploration_protocol","value":false,"label":{"zh":"探险协议","en":"Exploration Protocols"}}]]},{"key":"story.501.a.exploratobot","label":{"zh":"已登记温顺太空生命！","en":"Docile spaceborne cataloged!"},"responses":[],"tooltips":[],"conditional":true,"next":[],"terminal":false,"when":[[{"type":"identity","key":"civic_machine_exploration_protocol","value":true,"label":{"zh":"探险协议","en":"Exploration Protocols"}}]]},{"key":"first_contact_critters.15.A","label":{"zh":"令人着迷。","en":"Very fascinating."},"responses":[],"tooltips":[],"conditional":true,"next":[],"terminal":false,"when":[[{"type":"identity","key":"ethic_materialist","value":false,"label":{"zh":"唯物主义","en":"Materialist"}},{"type":"identity","key":"ethic_spiritualist","value":false,"label":{"zh":"唯心主义","en":"Spiritualist"}},{"type":"identity","key":"ethic_gestalt_consciousness","value":false,"label":{"zh":"格式塔意识","en":"Gestalt Consciousness"}}]],"labels":[{"label":{"zh":"令人着迷。","en":"Very fascinating."},"when":[[{"type":"other","key":"is_homicidal","arg":"no","scope":"owner","value":false}]]},{"label":{"zh":"打靶练习。","en":"Target practice."},"when":[[{"type":"other","key":"is_homicidal","arg":"yes","scope":"owner","value":true}]]}]}],"next":[{"target":"galactic_features.387","kind":"condition","conditional":true,"delayed":false,"sourceKind":"condition","group":"c13692","when":[[[{"type":"other","key":"is_country_type","arg":"default","scope":"contact_country","value":false}],[{"type":"other","key":"has_first_contact_flag","arg":"hostile_first_contact_attempted","scope":"","value":true}]],[[{"type":"flag","scope":"country","name":"tiyanki_graveyard_survey","path":"","value":true}]]],"source":"common/scripted_effects/first_contact_effects.txt:178","hooks":["after"],"story":"event-galactic-features-387"},{"target":"cara.1020","kind":"condition","conditional"